                <pb facs="1040" n="935" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/pg935"/>


                <head>Memorandum From Lay to All Holders of NSC 5919</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1960-01-28">January 28,
                        1960</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d225-13" n="13" type="facsimile" xml:id="d225-13"/>
                <p>As indicated by the second paragraph of the NOTE following NSC Action No. 2181
                    (adopted by the National Security Council at the 433rd meeting on January 21 and
                    approved by the President on January 26, 1960), this Action obviated the need
                    for a statement of policy on Cargo Air Lift as proposed in NSC 5919, which was
                    accordingly removed from the NSC agenda.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">James S. Lay, Jr.</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Executive Secretary</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
